{"id":"REC-01-deleted-citation-versus-rename-and-rewrite","status":"confirmed-observation","summary":"Fresh CLI and fresh MCP both return a clean reconcile for a deleted sole citation; rewrite blocks, rename is mechanical, unchanged stays clean."}
